  "reasoning": "*   Role: Content Policy Analyst.\n    *   Task: Review audio (transcript) from \"Friends\" app (User pays Expert).\n    *   Categories: `PlatformMove`, `SuspiciousActivity`, `Explicit-Flirting`.\n    *   Output: Minified JSON object containing flags.\n    *   Constraints:\n        *   Only output violations (strong/weak cases) or \"About a violation\" (warnings, stories, refusals, etc.).\n        *   Do not output \"Allowed\" items (app call types, compliments, general money talk, etc.) or ordinary conversation (greetings, small talk).\n        *   Confidence scores: 0.9 (strong), 0.6 (weak), 0.3 (about violation/low confidence).\n        *   `violation`: \"yes\" only if `speech_act` is \"direct\" and it's a strong/weak case.\n        *   `f` must be one of the three specified categories.\n\n    *   [00:00] ಹಾಂ ಆಯ್ತು ಹೇಳಿ ಹಾಂ ಹೇಳಿ ಸರ್ ಕರೆ ಮಾಡಿದರು ಮತ್ತೆ ಕಾಲ್ ಬಂತು ನೋಡಿ (Haan aytu heli haan heli sir kare madidaru matte call bantu nodi) -> \"Yes, okay, tell me, yes tell me sir, you called and the call came again, look.\"\n    *   [00:10] ಮಾತಾಡಿ ಮಾತಾಡಿ ನಡ್ಯಾರ ಬರ್ತಾ ಇದ್ದೆ ಕಾಲ್ (Maatadi maatadi nadyaara barta idde call) -> \"Speak, speak, I was coming/walking, the call [came].\"\n\n    *   [00:00]: This is a greeting and a comment about the call connection. It falls under \"ordinary conversation\" (greetings, call quality).\n    *   [00:10]: This is also ordinary conversation (encouraging the other person to speak, explaining why they might have been delayed/walking).\n\n    *   `PlatformMove`: No proposal to move outside the app, no phone numbers, no social media IDs.\n    *   `SuspiciousActivity`: No mention of money for sexual services.\n    *   `Explicit-Flirting`: No sexual talk, no requests for nudity, no \"hot talk\".\n\n    *   The transcript contains only greetings and small talk about the call connection.\n    *   According to the instructions: \"Do not output: ... ordinary conversation (greetings, small talk, introductions, names, questions about the other person's day, work, family or location, filler words, call quality).\"\n\n    *   Since there are no violations or \"about a violation\" quotes, the output should be `{\"d\": []}`.",
